{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing invocation-end ordering contract.** Existing plugin configuration documented hooks as registration-ordered, so globally reversing end hooks can break deployed plugins whose flushing or cleanup depends on that order. Retain registration order for existing plugin lists, or introduce an explicit opt-in/versioned LIFO scope mechanism.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774RnY","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"ced67b3c0986e90c6992e9b7301d942604cf38faacbbc2856394d84db067ba05","observation_id":"aro_v1_z3lhwpajq3uqy2ms5g3tahmuey","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:09Z","review_id":"arr_v1_dfsghg7x42wurlqw3jtatlfyq7","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"e28732585b856fb3f3117acf4b2d8b5162423d7c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_upfkwu2jtlys2disrvydtx5yuu","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:09Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
